ecruited%20units%2C%20so%20it%20may%20be%20unwise%20to%20dismiss%20such%20units%20or%20to%20send%20them%20to%20a%20foolish%20death.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22loyal%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22overlay%22%2C%22add%22%3A%22misc%2Floyal-icon.png%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22trait%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22resilient%22%2C%22male_name%22%3A%22resilient%22%2C%22female_name%22%3A%22female%5Eresilient%22%2C%22help_text%22%3A%22%3Ci%3EResilient%3C%2Fi%3E%20units%20have%20an%20additional%204%20hitpoints%2C%20and%20gain%201%20more%20per%20level.%5Cn%5Cn_%20Resilient%20units%20can%20be%20useful%20at%20all%20stages%20of%20a%20campaign%2C%20and%20this%20is%20a%20useful%20trait%20for%20all%20units.%20Resilient%20is%20often%20most%20helpful%20as%20a%20trait%20when%20it%20occurs%20in%20a%20unit%20that%20has%20some%20combination%20of%20low%20hitpoints%2C%20good%20defense%2C%20or%20high%20resistances.%20Resilient%20units%20are%20especially%20useful%20for%20holding%20strategic%20positions%20against%20opponents.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22hitpoints%22%2C%22increase_total%22%3A%224%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22effect%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22apply_to%22%3A%22hitpoints%22%2C%22times%22%3A%22per%20level%22%2C%22increase_total%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22teleport%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%22%24x1%22%2C%22y%22%3A%22%24y1%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22scroll_to%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22remove_shroud%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A%222-4%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2221-24%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22redraw%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22What%E2%80%99s%20this%2C%20more%20trolls%3F%20Aye%2C%20come%20to%20papa%2C%20little%20whelps.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Hello%3F%20Who%20is%20here%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22What%20in%20the%20world%20are%20you%3F%20Some%20sort%20o%E2%80%99%20monster%E2%80%99s%20appendage%20set%20tae%20lure%20me%20down%20to%20be%20yer%20watery%20meal%2C%20eh%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22male_message%22%3A%22I%20am%20a%20merman%2C%20dweller%20of%20the%20vast%20oceans!%20Do%20not%20ask%20me%20what%20I%20am%20doing%20in%20a%20cave.%20My%20lord%20can%20be%20somewhat%20eccentric.%20We%20are%20fighting%20at%20the%20side%20of%20your%20fellow%20cave-dwellers%20to%20drive%20back%20the%20orcs%20and%20trolls.%22%2C%22female_message%22%3A%22I%20am%20a%20mermaid%2C%20dweller%20of%20the%20vast%20oceans!%20Do%20not%20ask%20me%20what%20I%20am%20doing%20in%20a%20cave.%20My%20lord%20can%20be%20somewhat%20eccentric.%20We%20are%20fighting%20at%20the%20side%20of%20your%20fellow%20cave-dwellers%20to%20drive%20back%20the%20orcs%20and%20trolls.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22(sniffs)%20A%20mer-mahn.%20Never%20heard%20of%20it.%20I%20doubt%20yer%20as%20tasty%20as%20my%20friends%20here.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22show_if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22gender%22%3A%22male%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22(sniffs)%20A%20mer-mead.%20Never%20heard%20of%20it.%20I%20doubt%20yer%20as%20tasty%20as%20my%20friends%20here.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22show_if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22gender%22%3A%22female%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Why%20are%20you%20down%20here%3F%20Are%20those...%20troll%20carcasses%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20was%20brawlin%E2%80%99%20with%20these%20wee%20pups%20here%20defending%20my%20outpost.%20We%20got%20a%20little%20carried%20away%2C%20fell%20in%20the%20water%2C%20and%20were%20sucked%20down%20intae%20this%20grotto.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22How%20long%20have%20you%20been%20here%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Och%2C%20several%20days%20at%20least.%20The%20troll%20meat%20is%20starting%20to%20stink%2C%20and%20I%E2%80%99m%20a%20little%20ravenous%2C%20if%20ye%20catch%20my%20drift.%20Canna%E2%80%99%20swim%20past%20that%20current%2C%20and%20no%E2%80%99%20for%20lack%20o%E2%80%99%20tryin%E2%80%99.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%226%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2223%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20will%20rescue%20you.%20Hold%20onto%20my%20shoulders%2C%20sir%20dwarf.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Thanks.%20Nae%20need%20to%20wait%20around%20here.%20Let%E2%80%99s%20go.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22store_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22kill%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22variable%22%3A%22stored_Ulfdain%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ulfdain%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
