          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("What’s this, more trolls? Aye, come to papa, little whelps."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hello? Who is here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("What in the world are you? Some sort o’ monster’s appendage set tae lure me down to be yer watery meal, eh?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _(""),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("(sniffs) A mer-mahn. Never heard of it. I doubt yer as tasty as my friends here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("(sniffs) A mer-mead. Never heard of it. I doubt yer as tasty as my friends here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Why are you down here? Are those... troll carcasses?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("I was brawlin’ with these wee pups here defending my outpost. We got a little carried away, fell in the water, and were sucked down intae this grotto."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("How long have you been here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("Och, several days at least. The troll meat is starting to stink, and I’m a little ravenous, if ye catch my drift. Canna’ swim past that current, and no’ for lack o’ tryin’."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I will rescue you. Hold onto my shoulders, sir dwarf."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ulfdain",
            text: _("Thanks. Nae need to wait around here. Let’s go."),
          },
