              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("Argh! I am vanquished! But at least by worthy foes, instead of those disgusting orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Rest in peace, Lionel. The poor, lost general."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("I am destroyed, but my mission must be completed. Though you are foes, you are at least worthy ones, so I will tell you that the Sceptre is east from here, the way you have come from, deep in the caverns. I made the mistake of not asking for directions when I became lost. May you have better fortune in your quest than I did!"),
          },
        ],
      },
